  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 902.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 902.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to implement RSA 485:23 and RSA 485:24 by establishing reasonable watershed management practices to protect the quality of surface waters used as sources of drinking water.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Dw 902) #10602, eff 5-20-14; ss by #13826, eff 10-26-21",
